        <title>new comment 4384772 (near Csemő) / * 2024 August 15 13:41 Created: Hosszú Dülő 8, 2712 Nyársapát / Updated &lt;time title=&quot;20 May 2025 at 12:22&quot; datetime=&quot;2025-05-20T12:22:18Z&quot;&gt;5 months ago&lt;/time&gt; by &lt;a class=&quot;mw-100 d-inline-block align-bottom text-truncate text-wrap&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; href=&quot;https://www.openstreetmap.org/user/GhostOfSparta&quot;&gt;GhostOfSparta&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
